sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant Entry as Telegram or CLI
    participant Hub as HubOrchestrator.learn
    participant Mem as Long-term memory
    participant Ctx as Skills and approved docs
    participant LLM as Structured learning analysis
    participant Skill as HubSkillStore

    You->>Entry: /learn lesson
    Entry->>Hub: explicit learning command
    Hub->>Mem: store authoritative operator memory
    Mem-->>Hub: memory id
    Hub->>Ctx: retrieve bounded relevant context
    Ctx-->>Hub: runtime skills and approved docs
    Hub->>LLM: classify memory type and action
    alt analysis fails
        LLM-->>Hub: error
        Hub-->>Entry: memory stored, analysis failed plainly
    else analysis succeeds
        LLM-->>Hub: memory type and recommended action
        alt procedural reclassification needed
            Hub->>Mem: reclassify stored memory type
            Mem-->>Hub: same memory id, updated type
        end
        alt valid runtime skill action
            Hub->>Skill: validate and create or version skill
            Skill-->>Hub: accepted or rejected with reason
            Hub-->>Entry: stored memory plus skill result
        else memory or proposal outcome
            Hub-->>Entry: stored memory plus recommendation
        end
    end
    Entry-->>You: concise learning confirmation
